{
  "_about": "Expected GitHub Actions OIDC trust policies for every AWS role a spore.host workflow assumes (spore-host#709). scripts/check_oidc_trusts.py checks them in CI, and compares a live `aws iam get-role` against them: see README.md. No account may appear here that spawn's forbiddenTrustAccounts refuses (942542972736).",
